    {
      "source": "Create a new instance of <a href=\"Record.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.connection.stream\"><code>Record</code></a> with the given <a href=\"RecordId.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.connection.stream\"><code>RecordId</code></a>.",
