    {
      "source": "Apply the given <a href=\"../../hash/HashMapper.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.hash\"><code>HashMapper</code></a> to the backing value to create a new <a href=\"MapRecord.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.connection.stream\"><code>MapRecord</code></a>. An already assigned\n<a href=\"RecordId.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.connection.stream\"><code>id</code></a> is carried over to the new instance.",
      "translation": "将给定的 <a href=\"../../hash/HashMapper.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.hash\"><code>HashMapper</code></a> 应用于底层值，以创建一个新的 <a href=\"MapRecord.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.connection.stream\"><code>MapRecord</code></a>。已分配的 <a href=\"RecordId.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.connection.stream\"><code>id</code></a> 将被传递到新实例中。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "A <a href=\"Record.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.connection.stream\"><code>Record</code></a> within the stream mapped to a single object. This may be a simple type, such as <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>String</code></a> or a\ncomplex one.",
      "translation": "流中的<a href=\"Record.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.connection.stream\"><code>Record</code></a>映射到单个对象。该对象可以是简单类型，例如<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>String</code></a>，也可以是复杂类型。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Apply the given <a href=\"../../hash/HashMapper.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.hash\"><code>HashMapper</code></a> to the backing value to create a new <a href=\"MapRecord.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.connection.stream\"><code>MapRecord</code></a>.",
      "translation": "将给定的<a href=\"../../hash/HashMapper.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.hash\"><code>HashMapper</code></a>应用于底层值，以创建一个新的<a href=\"MapRecord.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.connection.stream\"><code>MapRecord</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
